{% style %}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
    padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: {{ section.settings.color_background }};
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
      padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top_mobile }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}
{{ 'em-manual.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<div class="em-wrap">
  <section class="em-ch em-ch-section" id="quick-start" style="scroll-margin-top:180px">
    <p class="em-ch__num">01 · Start</p>
    <h2>Quick start</h2>
    <p class="em-ch__lead">Five steps to the first session.</p>
    <div class="em-qs">
      <article class="em-qs__s">
        {%- if section.settings.img_charge != blank -%}
          {{- section.settings.img_charge | image_url: width: 400 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: '', class: '' -}}
        {%- else -%}
          <img src="{{ 'step-charge-ink.webp' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
        {%- endif -%}
        <span class="em-qs__n" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
        <h3>Charge</h3>
        <p>Charge the battery fully before you begin: about 3 hours for the standard battery, 1 h 45 min for Battery Plus, over USB-C with a 30 W PD charger or stronger. The four LEDs climb to full.</p>
        <small>Leave it on the charger for the full time, even once the LEDs read full.</small>
      </article>
      <article class="em-qs__s">
        {%- if section.settings.img_fill != blank -%}
          {{- section.settings.img_fill | image_url: width: 400 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: '' -}}
        {%- else -%}
          <img src="{{ 'step-fill-ink.webp' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
        {%- endif -%}
        <span class="em-qs__n" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
        <h3>Fill</h3>
        <p>Twist off the glass water tank and fill it with cold water up to the level indicator. Cold water cools the vapour for a smoother draw.</p>
        <small>Ice cubes make it cooler still. They raise the water level, so fill a little below the line.</small>
      </article>
      <article class="em-qs__s">
        {%- if section.settings.img_pack != blank -%}
          {{- section.settings.img_pack | image_url: width: 400 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: '' -}}
        {%- else -%}
          <img src="{{ 'step-pack-ink.webp' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
        {%- endif -%}
        <span class="em-qs__n" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
        <h3>Pack</h3>
        <p>Pack the cup lightly with your tobacco, 8–15 g, then open an airpath straight down the middle with the poking tool.</p>
        <small>A mesh screen at the bottom of the cup keeps the flavor in longer. Mid-session, loosen the edges with the poking tool.</small>
      </article>
      <article class="em-qs__s">
        {%- if section.settings.img_tune != blank -%}
          {{- section.settings.img_tune | image_url: width: 400 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: '' -}}
        {%- else -%}
          <img src="{{ 'step-tune-ink.webp' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
        {%- endif -%}
        <span class="em-qs__n" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
        <h3>Tune</h3>
        <p>Set the thermodial to 180°, then hold it in for 2–3 seconds until the light turns orange. The 5-minute pre-heat starts; the light in the middle climbs as it warms.</p>
        <small>Vapour light at the start? Go up 15–30° at a time and give each change 30–60 seconds.</small>
      </article>
      <article class="em-qs__s">
        {%- if section.settings.img_enjoy != blank -%}
          {{- section.settings.img_enjoy | image_url: width: 400 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: '' -}}
        {%- else -%}
          <img src="{{ 'step-enjoy-ink.webp' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
        {%- endif -%}
        <span class="em-qs__n" aria-hidden="true">5</span>
        <h3>Enjoy</h3>
        <p>Draw slowly and steadily. Electric heat: no charcoal, no ash, no open flame.</p>
        <small>Every tobacco likes its own heat. See Temperature and the three modes below.</small>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "EM: Quick Start",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Step images"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "img_charge",
      "label": "Step 1: Charge"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "img_fill",
      "label": "Step 2: Fill"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "img_pack",
      "label": "Step 3: Pack"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "img_tune",
      "label": "Step 4: Tune"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "img_enjoy",
      "label": "Step 5: Enjoy"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "color_background",
      "label": "Background",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding top (desktop)",
      "default": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding bottom (desktop)",
      "default": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top_mobile",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding top (mobile)",
      "default": 40
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom_mobile",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding bottom (mobile)",
      "default": 40
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "EM: Quick Start"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
